<title>FINLAND: Nokia, Dassault win FRF 280 mln deal.</title>
<headline>Nokia, Dassault win FRF 280 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said on Friday it was in a partnership with Dassault A.T. to deliver a 280 million French francs turnkey DCS 1800 cellular network to Bouygues Telecom of France.</p>
<p>&quot;The value of the contract signed with the GIE Dassault A.T. - Nokia is in the order of 280 million French francs,&quot; Nokia said in a statement.</p>
</text>
